## To release a new version, edit the version in the two lines below and nothing else.
## |cRRGGBB...|r in Title and Author colours them in the in-game add-on list; the version
## is read back through that markup, so it can sit inside or outside the colour.
## The settings panel takes its version from ## Title; the name itself is fixed in Core.lua.
## Title: |cFF69B4PB's Lowest Price Finder|r 0.4.1
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: Finds the guild store that sells the items you watch at the lowest price, and where its trader stands. Open a guild trader and every store you can open is searched for your watched items; the cheapest store of each item is shown, with the trader's place once you have seen it. The prices are remembered, so the answer is still there after you leave.
## Version: 0.4.1
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## OptionalDependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings>=20106
## SavedVariables: PBsLowestPriceFinder_Data

lang/strings.lua
lang/$(language).lua

Core.lua
Places.lua
Scan.lua
Panel.lua
Bar.lua
Settings.lua
Main.lua

